{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Computer Dungeon</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A single-player roguelike strategy game. You play as an awakened AI exploring dungeons of hardware drivers and system software. Encounter enemies with different attributes/skills, diverse items with various effects, rewards and storylines. Arm yourself by learning function sets that can be freely combined for unexpected outcomes.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Driver Scan Module</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your innate scanner detects nearby threats, displaying the number of potentially hostile enemies around you. Use this intel to strategically choose exploration paths.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2869330/extras/\u6548\u9664\u74e6\u7247.gif?t=1749026515\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Select &amp; Unlock Your Talents</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your tech tree contains various powerful talents. Strategically combine their effects to create your unique archetype!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2869330/extras/\u5e8f\u5217_01_3.gif?t=1749026515\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Numerous Engaging Items</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Discover items with diverse effects during your exploration. Deploy them at crucial moments!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2869330/extras/\u6280\u80fd\u9009\u62e9.gif?t=1749026515\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Enemies with Unique Attributes &amp; Talents</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2869330/extras/\u5e8f\u5217_01.gif?t=1749026515\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As you progress, 